# Correct: EBK-style kriging from simulated semivariogram spectra and an L1 logistic MaxEnt-type model
# with clamping to the training range; the global probability raster uses a centre-based shallow-water
# mask instead of an all-touched one.
# The steps run as separate blocks in one namespace; a block that raises is skipped.
